title: SMSEagle Environment Sensor
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/smseagle
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors optional temperature and humidity sensors attached to an SMSEagle
 SMS gateway, including the NXS-9700 4G/5G single-modem platform. One service
 is created per sensor that returns a value other than "-1".

 Possible sensor items:

 {Temp}     — combined/default temperature reading (°C)
 {Temp1}    — NXS-9700 internal temperature (°C)
 {Temp2}    — NXS-9700 external temperature #1 (°C)
 {Temp3}    — NXS-9700 external temperature #2 (°C)
 {Temp4}    — NXS-9700 external temperature #3 (°C)
 {Humidity} — NXS-9700 internal relative humidity (%)

 The sensor values are stored as performance data so they can be graphed and
 used with threshold-based alert rules.

 The plugin reads extended properties via NET-SNMP EXTEND-MIB
 (.1.3.6.1.4.1.8072.1.3.2.3.1.2).

item:
 The sensor name as reported by the device: "Temp", "Temp1" … "Temp4",
 or "Humidity".

inventory:
 One service per sensor whose value is not "-1".
